---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Ghana Constitution Privacy Notice - LogicPath Systems">
    <section class="legal-page" style="padding-top: 120px; min-height: 100vh;">
        <div class="container reveal">
            <div class="glass-card" style="padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);">
                <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem; text-align: center;">
                    <h1 class="gradient-text">Privacy Notice</h1>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);"><strong>App:</strong> Ghana Constitution</p>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);"><strong>Last updated:</strong> 17 September 2026</p>
                </header>

                <main class="legal-content">
                    <p><strong>LogicPath Systems</strong> ("we", "us") publishes <strong>Ghana Constitution</strong>, a free, ad-supported app for reading the Constitution of the Republic of Ghana (1992). This notice explains what information the app handles and why.</p>

                    <h2>1. What stays on your phone</h2>
                    <p>The app keeps the following only on your device:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Saved articles</strong> and the <strong>notes</strong> you write</li>
                        <li><strong>Reading log</strong> — articles opened, day streak and study cards reviewed</li>
                        <li><strong>Recently opened articles</strong> and recent filter words</li>
                        <li><strong>Display choices</strong> — appearance and reading size</li>
                    </ul>
                    <blockquote style="border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-primary); padding-left: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
                        <p>We never receive this information. It is removed when you clear the app's data or uninstall the app.</p>
                    </blockquote>

                    <h2>2. What we do not collect</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li>No account or sign-in</li>
                        <li>No names, email addresses or phone numbers</li>
                        <li>No precise location, camera, microphone or contacts</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>3. Advertising (Google AdMob)</h2>
                    <p>The app shows advertisements through <strong>Google AdMob</strong> to fund its development. AdMob may collect certain information automatically, including:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Device identifiers (Advertising ID)</li>
                        <li>IP address</li>
                        <li>General location (country or region, not precise)</li>
                        <li>App usage and interaction with ads</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>Google AdMob's data practices are governed by <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
                    <p><strong>Your consent.</strong> If you are in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom, Switzerland or another region where a privacy message is required, the app shows Google's consent message before any ad is requested. You can change your choice at any time in <strong>Preferences › Ad privacy choices</strong>. If you do not agree to personalised ads, Google may still show non-personalised ads, which rely on limited data such as your approximate location.</p>
                    <p>You can also limit personalised advertising by:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Opening your device's <strong>Settings › Google › Ads</strong> and deleting or resetting your Advertising ID</li>
                        <li>Or visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">Google's Ad Settings</a></li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>4. Usage statistics (Google Analytics for Firebase)</h2>
                    <p>The app uses <strong>Google Analytics for Firebase</strong> to understand which screens are used, so we can improve the app. It may collect:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Screen views and app usage events</li>
                        <li>An app instance ID and device information (model, operating system version, language)</li>
                        <li>Approximate country or region</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>It does not receive your notes or saved articles. Google's handling of this data is described in <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

                    <h2>5. Permissions</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Internet</strong> — to load ads and send usage statistics. Reading the Constitution works offline.</li>
                        <li>Read aloud uses your phone's built-in text-to-speech engine, and sharing uses the system share sheet.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>No camera, microphone, contacts or storage permissions are required.</p>

                    <h2>6. Third-party services</h2>
                    <div style="overflow-x: auto;">
                        <table style="width: 100%; text-align: left; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
                            <thead>
                                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
                                    <th style="padding: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">Service</th>
                                    <th style="padding: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">Purpose</th>
                                    <th style="padding: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-primary);">Privacy policy</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
                                    <td style="padding: 0.5rem;">Google AdMob</td>
                                    <td style="padding: 0.5rem;">Advertising</td>
                                    <td style="padding: 0.5rem;"><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">policies.google.com/privacy</a></td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td style="padding: 0.5rem;">Google Analytics for Firebase</td>
                                    <td style="padding: 0.5rem;">Usage statistics</td>
                                    <td style="padding: 0.5rem;"><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">policies.google.com/privacy</a></td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                    <p>Fonts are bundled inside the app and do <strong>not</strong> make network requests.</p>

                    <h2>7. Children</h2>
                    <p>The app is a general-audience reference. We do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone, including children under 13.</p>

                    <h2>8. Deleting your data</h2>
                    <p>Everything the app stores is on your device. You can delete it at any time by:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Opening <strong>Settings › Apps › Ghana Constitution › Storage › Clear data</strong></li>
                        <li>Uninstalling the app</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>9. Changes to this notice</h2>
                    <p>We may update this notice from time to time. Changes will appear in the app with a new "Last updated" date.</p>

                    <h2>10. Contact</h2>
                    <p><strong>LogicPath Systems</strong></p>
                    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:contact@logicpathsystems.com" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">contact@logicpathsystems.com</a></p>
                </main>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    .legal-content h2, .legal-content h3 {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .legal-content h2 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .legal-content h3 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
    }
    
    .legal-content p, .legal-content ul, .legal-content table, .legal-content blockquote {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
        padding-left: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .legal-content li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
</style>
